"# Fix Brief — shop (incident inc-20261023-080000-abcd)

> خلاصه برای شما: علت محتمل «order.items برای بعضی سفارش‌ها undefined است» (اطمینان 85٪) در src/orders.js:14. این متن را به Agent برنامه‌نویسی خود (Cursor، Claude Code، Copilot…) بدهید؛ همهٔ اطلاعات لازم در آن هست و هیچ secret‌ای ندارد.

## 1. Problem

The app throws \`TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'length')\` while serving \`GET /api/orders/5\`.

Impact on end users: requests to GET /api/orders/5 fail with an error instead of a valid response.

## 2. Evidence

- Failing endpoint: \`GET /api/orders/5\`
- Started at: 2026-10-23T08:00:00.000Z
- Related release: v7

\`\`\`text
TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'length')
    at summarize (/app/src/orders.js:14:29)
    at Server.<anonymous> (/app/src/server.js:20:31)
    connecting with postgres://app:***@shop-db.internal:5432/shop
    callback https://hooks.example.com/notify?token=[REDACTED]
\`\`\`

## 3. Suspected location

- File: \`src/orders.js\`, line 14, function \`summarize\`
- Probable cause (85% confidence): order.items برای بعضی سفارش‌ها undefined است — تابع summarize بدون بررسی items طول آن را می‌خواند.

## 4. Reproduce locally

\`\`\`sh
PORT=3000 npm start
curl -i http://localhost:3000/api/orders/5
npm test
\`\`\`

## 5. Acceptance criteria

- [ ] \`curl -i http://localhost:3000/api/orders/5\` returns HTTP 200 (not 500)
- [ ] \`npm test\` passes
- [ ] A new regression test covers this exact case
- [ ] \`GET /health\` (or \`/\`) still returns 200 (smoke test)

## 6. Constraints

- Fix only this bug; no refactors or unrelated changes.
- Do not touch environment variables, \`liara.json\`, lockfiles or deploy settings.
- Add a test that fails before the fix and passes after it.
- The app reads these env vars (names only, values are not part of this brief): \`DATABASE_URL\`, \`PORT\`

